@cultivation = http://localhost:9001
@auth = http://localhost:9002

### 1. 재배 생성 (OWNER = userId 100)
POST {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations
X-User-Id: 100
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "테스트 농장",
  "mushroomId": 1
}

### 2. 재배 목록 조회
GET {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations
X-User-Id: 100

### 3. 재배 상세 조회
GET {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations/1
X-User-Id: 100

### 4. 멤버 추가 성공 (userId=200을 MEMBER로 추가)
POST {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations/1/members
X-User-Id: 100
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 200,
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

### 5. 멤버 추가 실패 - OWNER 역할로 추가 시도 (400)
POST {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations/1/members
X-User-Id: 100
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 201,
  "role": "OWNER"
}

### 6. 멤버 추가 실패 - 요청자가 방장이 아님 (403)
POST {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations/1/members
X-User-Id: 200
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 202,
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

### 7. 멤버 목록 조회 (auth_server 배치조회로 nickname까지 채워져야 함)
GET {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations/1/members
X-User-Id: 100

### 8. 멤버 권한 수정 (200 -> MANAGER)
PUT {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations/1/members/200
X-User-Id: 100
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "MANAGER"
}

### 9. 방장 위임 (100 -> 200)
PUT {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations/1/owner
X-User-Id: 100
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 200
}

### 10. 방장 위임 실패 - 자기 자신에게 위임 (400)
PUT {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations/1/owner
X-User-Id: 200
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 200
}

### 11. 멤버 삭제
DELETE {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations/1/members/200
X-User-Id: 100

### 12. 재배 이력 조회 (페이징)
GET {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations/history?page=0&size=20
X-User-Id: 100

### 13. 재배 종료
PUT {{cultivation}}/api/cultivations/1/finish
X-User-Id: 100


### ===== auth_server =====

### 14. 사용자 검색 (담당자 추가 모달용, 닉네임 일부/이메일 완전일치)
GET {{auth}}/users/search?keyword=nick

### 15. userId 목록으로 일괄 조회 (멤버 목록 닉네임 채우기용)
GET {{auth}}/users/batch?ids=100,200